    expected_output: "READY FOR COMMANDS"
    key_metric: 100000
    narrative: |
      Balanced ternary kernel (boots in 0.236ms)
      Sacred opcodes in hardware (54 opcodes)
      Quantum layer (15 quantum opcodes)
      KOSCHEI UNIVERSE (Omniverse simulation)

  - name: slide12_Hardware
