      KOSCHEI: Omniscient discovery engine
      100% open source

  - name: slide14_Performance
    title: "Performance: 100000x Speedup Achieved"
    demo_command: "tri bench --full"
    expected_output: "100000x vs binary OS"
    key_metric: 100000
    narrative: |
      Sacred math: 1200x vs CPU
      Blind spots: 2500x vs CPU
      Quantum sim: 25000x vs classical
      TRINITY OS: 100000x vs binary OS
